    {
      "id": 970000000008,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / POLYPHONIC MOTION PAD\n\nHostMIDI is saved for EIGHT voice Reuse polyphony.\nHold layered MIDI chords; Pitch CV travels\npolyphonically to MorphVCO and filter cutoff.\n\nMIDI gate/retrigger -> poly ADSR -> poly VCA.\nPolyphonic VCA audio is summed by HostAudio2.\n\nMacro8: COLOR / RESONANCE / WARMTH / WIDTH.\nIts four saved A-D snapshots crossfade in 1.8s;\nWIDTH uses bipolar -5V..+5V for PWM.\n\nTry A then B on a held chord; C adds pulses,\nD is smoother. Use LIVE for real-time knobs.\n\nMotion is manually triggered by snapshot recall;\nthere is no automatic tempo/LFO animation.\nStart with low monitoring volume; this patch\nhas source-checked cables, not auditioned audio.\n",
        "width": 29
      },
      "pos": [
        78,
        0
      ]
    }
